Package: gx-shell
Version: @VERSION@
Section: shells
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: gx0404 <gx0404@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Provides: herdr
Conflicts: herdr, herdr-gx, ohmyzsh-gx, wezterm-gx
Replaces: herdr-gx, ohmyzsh-gx, wezterm-gx
Homepage: https://github.com/gx0404/gx_shell
Description: WezTerm GX terminal, GX Zsh (Oh My Zsh GX) and herdr in one package
 GX Shell bundles the WezTerm GX terminal with its configuration, plugins and
 fonts, the isolated Oh My Zsh GX profile on a pinned Zsh runtime (gx-zsh), and
 the herdr terminal workspace manager. WezTerm starts GX Zsh by default.
 User configuration is created only when an ordinary user runs a launcher;
 maintainer scripts never modify HOME, existing dotfiles or the login shell.
